## config/requests.json

```json
{
  "getResource": {
    "schema": {
      "method": "GET",
      "host": "<%= iparam.api_base_url %>",
      "path": "/api/v1/resources/<%= context.resource_id %>",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <%= iparam.api_key %>",
        "Accept": "application/json"
      }
    }
  },
  "createResource": {
    "schema": {
      "method": "POST",
      "host": "<%= iparam.api_base_url %>",
      "path": "/api/v1/resources",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer <%= iparam.api_key %>",
        "Content-Type": "application/json"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Rules:**
- ✅ Host: FQDN only (api.example.com) - no path in host
- ✅ Path: Start with `/`
- ✅ Use `<%= iparam.name %>` for installation params
- ✅ Use `<%= context.name %>` for runtime params from args
- ✅ Use `<%= access_token %>` for OAuth
- ❌ NEVER use `{{variable}}` - use `<%= %>` (ERB syntax)

